    "relevant": [
      "CFC.sqrt_unique (Rpow/Basic.lean:283)",
      "CFC.mul_self_eq_mul_self_iff (Rpow/Basic.lean:294)",
      "IsSelfAdjoint.instNonUnitalContinuousFunctionalCalculus (Instances.lean:216)",
      "Lp.instCompleteSpace (LpSpace/Complete.lean:378)",
      "canonical60 L2RealComplexOperator.exists_positive_complex_lift",
      "actual61 RealDefectRoot.actual_positive_real_defect_root"
    ],
    "hidden_hypotheses": "CFC uniqueness requires StarOrderedRing plus restricted-real selfadjoint CFC, nonnegative spectrum/topology/module contracts; available internally on COMPLEX bounded operators, not assumed on bare REAL operator algebra. Complex L2 complete for arbitrary μ; no finite measure/dimension/Nontrivial.",
    "planned_route_at_most_seven": [
      "Use canonical60 positive complex lifts Ac,Bc of given positive real A,B, with literal formulas/intertwining on same μ.",
      "Derive exact real/imaginary projection identities of lifted outputs from canonical ofReal/re/im quotient maps; reconstruct g=ιRg+iιQg on entire complex L2.",
      "Using these formulas and A²=B², prove Ac²=Bc² on ALL complex L2; no density-only argument, extra energy premise or caller preservation.",
      "Construct the same proof-local complex/restricted-real CFC instances as actual61; convert Ac/Bc positivity to operator nonnegativity.",
